{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16122","headline":"赠王屋道士赴诏 · 王建","name":"赠王屋道士赴诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉皇符诏下天坛，玳瑁头簪白角冠。\n鹤遣院中童子养，鹿凭山下老人看。\n法成不怕刀枪利，体实常欺石榻寒。\n能断世间腥血昧，长生只要一丸丹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}